{"lines":"228","clause":"L3.2-SVD","page":"UNCHECKED","status":"PASS","derivation":"Thin SVD B=P Sigma U^T has U^TU=I_d and positive Sigma. det Sigma=sqrt(det(BB^T)); density scaling yields e^(d/2)det(BB^T)^(-1/2), and d=1 gives sqrt(e)/|a|.","objective_id":"QFORM-FIVE-270-REPAIRED-AUDIT-20260925","source_commit":"4e530247ec0ef4101a6e5ecf621bd35a969c42aa","source_blob":"98e45d53d106db9a205051a4dd4917fc39dc2e3a","account":"fleet03","slot":"B05","run_id":"20260925T104151Z-fleet03-B05-five270-repaired-r01"}
